    LLM: "The player to dealer's right leads any card. Other players must follow suit. A player who cannot follow suit must draw cards one at a time from the stock until finding a card of the required suit, which must then be played. The highest card of the led suit wins the trick, and the winner leads to the next trick. If the stock runs out, players who cannot follow suit simply pass without playing.",
